These rule files are copied unchanged from socfortress/CoPilot-Search-Queries
(https://github.com/socfortress/CoPilot-Search-Queries, GPL-3.0), commit
cda78327c10c82cb292fde8f5471823cff5dbf90: one per detections/ folder plus the
shapes the catalog has to handle (parameters as a list with an unquoted
schema_version, aggregation blocks, CVE tags, a PowerShell 4104 rule).

They feed copilot-yaml's vectors (scripts/gen-yaml-vectors.py) and the GitHub
stand-ins of the copilot-searches e2e and parity suites.
